強くなければ春馬は会ってくれない――。神ノ原でトップになるため、皆実は「モンスト部」の設立を宣言した！ しかし、モンスト部など認めないという\"生徒会長\"が現れ……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-04-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lRr8CLZn2lPVNGdxG4dGeebGC6i.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lRr8CLZn2lPVNGdxG4dGeebGC6i.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"1329278","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"本来の力を発揮することができず力尽きる龍馬――。呆気ない幕切れに困惑するレンの傍ら、真っ向から勝負を挑む葵とナポレオンの逆転劇が幕を開ける！ 果たして勝負の行方は...…!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-05-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g65XrYi13layEqToPUeLxznB5ep.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g65XrYi13layEqToPUeLxznB5ep.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"1329279","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"次こそ龍馬を使いこなさないと――。気持ちが焦るレンだが、桜以上の実力を持つゼウスに太刀打ちできずにいた。 神威やナポレオンも苦戦する中、レンは明から言われた\"ある言葉\"を思い出し......!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-05-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mPVf4MyUTVB3X1DQqDWbkhIoZeR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mPVf4MyUTVB3X1DQqDWbkhIoZeR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"1329280","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"連戦の疲れを癒しにカフェを訪れたレンたち。そこには、皆風を崇高するがあまり暴走している茜の姿が！彼女を止めようとモンストバトルを挑むが、そこはコンサート会場のようで……!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-05-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aJvaxtmjVYG6cPwfRO6hbfVM54j.jpg