Episodio 28","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"太陽たちと共に再び渋谷へ訪れ、春馬との再会を果たすレンたち。しかし、春馬は会話を拒絶し姿を消してしまう……。 後を追おうとしたその時、新たなる敵が立ちはだかる！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-06-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gbxqL3wC15PY6YvnDItmzldPSNu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gbxqL3wC15PY6YvnDItmzldPSNu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/28"},{"id":"1329285","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":29,"title":{"value":"Episodio 29","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"アリスのガトリング砲やトランプ兵を使ったトリッキーな攻撃に翻弄されるデッドラビッツ。 隙を狙って一矢報いるが、攻撃を受けたアリスは様子が一変！ 狂気のストライクショットが炸裂する......!!","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-06-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dJ8zlDlKKZJFpbR3RcAsGjIHlxW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dJ8zlDlKKZJFpbR3RcAsGjIHlxW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/29"},{"id":"1329286","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":30,"title":{"value":"Episodio 30","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"卑弥呼の埴輪型ロボットに対し、ナポレオンはウサギ軍団を召喚！ ロボットから放たれるレーザーと軍団の砲撃でバトルは大混戦する！ 一方、明と太陽は薫と対峙。神威とロキの前に、\"悪魔の影\"が立ちはだかる......！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-07-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q7sGfQfEnn2fMwmLHCpUHViw7D7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q7sGfQfEnn2fMwmLHCpUHViw7D7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/30"},{"id":"1329287","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":31,"title":{"value":"Episodio 31","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ロミオの圧倒的な力に倒れる神威。卑弥呼のストライクショットの直撃を食らうナポレオン。 絶望的な状況だが、明と葵は諦めない――。春馬にもう一度会うため、最後の力を振り絞る！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-07-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yjk5OQSf2DqGABVx2OjxLIT0pjh.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yjk5OQSf2DqGABVx2OjxLIT0pjh.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/31"},{"id":"1329288","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":32,"title":{"value":"Episodio 32","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"渋谷に再び降臨したルシファー。 「余興だ…」そう言い残すと、街中のカラスをバハムートに変え、レンたちに襲いかかる――!!","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-07-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":13,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/orjzf8JV2N46QhBy3zgD1PYxiO9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/orjzf8JV2N46QhBy3zgD1PYxiO9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/32"},{"id":"1329289","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":33,"title":{"value":"Episodio 33","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"敵の猛攻に必死に抵抗するが、圧倒的な大群の前に仲間たちは力尽きていく……。 ひとり取り残されたレンだが、仲間と春馬を守るため、龍馬と共に奮闘する！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-07-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":11,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yF77dgtUmTw2Qf4nVhVLdxMSYS8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yF77dgtUmTw2Qf4nVhVLdxMSYS8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/33"},{"id":"1329290","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":34,"title":{"value":"Episodio 34","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"1000体のバハムートを一掃し、新たな力を魅せつけた龍馬。その眼前に、ついに春馬とルシファーが立ちはだかる。ルシファーとの死闘、再び――!!","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-08-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":12,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pn7oeOtEOQ8h6N3BiXnh0rKt6d2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pn7oeOtEOQ8h6N3BiXnh0rKt6d2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/34"},{"id":"1329291","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":35,"title":{"value":"Episodio 35","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"炎の龍と堕天使のぶつかり合いで、街中に閃光が走る——！ 互いに譲らない激闘の一方、春馬の表情は苦痛に歪んでいた。その背後には、揺らめく謎の影が……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-08-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":13,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aSYyeawxC2R8KGFvinXKx6VZ4dc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aSYyeawxC2R8KGFvinXKx6VZ4dc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/35"},{"id":"1329292","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":36,"title":{"value":"Episodio 36","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"春馬に苦痛を与えていたのは、\"木の闘神 メメント・モリ\"だった！木の闘神なら、火属性の龍馬は有利――。 一気に勝負を決めようとした瞬間、あたりには霧が立ち込めて......!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-08-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":13,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fM35j9fASHFpJhg7OeH2mBbFyIj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fM35j9fASHFpJhg7OeH2mBbFyIj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/36"},{"id":"1329293","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":37,"title":{"value":"Episodio 37","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"春馬を取り戻すために、志乃、茉莉子、薫がメメント・モリに立ち向かう！ロミオとアリス、卑弥呼の強力な友情コンボでメメント・モリに応戦する。しかし、突如現れた\"黒い棺桶\"が、バトルの行方に暗雲を……!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-08-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":11,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s6nuFcLzSOHXQn6zk5YFpi9OC0b.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s6nuFcLzSOHXQn6zk5YFpi9OC0b.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/37"},{"id":"1329294","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":38,"title":{"value":"Episodio 38","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"メメント・モリとの戦いには、春馬だけではなく\"K\"——春馬の父”玄馬”の存在も関係していた。闘神が現れた理由とは？ 神ノ原の異変との関係は？ 玄馬の目的が明らかになる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-09-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zsV4AA6JfIKGyf6J1cDgXBWQdTE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zsV4AA6JfIKGyf6J1cDgXBWQdTE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/38"},{"id":"1329295","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":39,"title":{"value":"Episodio 39","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kの目的を知ったレンたちは、情報収集のために神ノ原へ戻ることに。 一方明は、春馬に\"確認したいこと\"があると言い残し、ひとり春馬の母が眠るメディカルセンターへと向かう――。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-09-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":11,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sfyAOpf8OmXE6DfoDQoTaRDCfRU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sfyAOpf8OmXE6DfoDQoTaRDCfRU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/39"},{"id":"1329296","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":40,"title":{"value":"Episodio 40","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kの暗躍を阻止するため、神ノ原のどこかにあるという素粒子研究センターを目指すことに。手がかりを探すため、レンたちのもとに太陽や志乃たちが集結する！ 一方、XFLAG PARKを間近に控えた気合十分のオラゴンは、リボン親衛隊を結成する!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-09-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zMi1mS3pVBQMQh10LXVZ5U8eezg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zMi1mS3pVBQMQh10LXVZ5U8eezg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/40"},{"id":"1329297","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":41,"title":{"value":"Episodio 41","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"人の想いが集まる場所を探せ――。春馬の助言をもとに、XFLAG PARKが行われる幕張メッセに来たレンたち。 大盛り上がりの会場内で、本来の目的を忘れて楽しむレンたちだが......!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-09-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rZO55GQz2Hh3jqC36yJTVplDTk5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rZO55GQz2Hh3jqC36yJTVplDTk5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/41"},{"id":"1329298","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":42,"title":{"value":"Episodio 42","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"突如として姿を消した志乃――。春馬は志乃の行方の手がかりを探すために神ノ原を訪れる。 共に探そうとするレンたちだが、そこに不気味な大蛇が襲いかかる......！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-10-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2CeYnsEH2TnR9RPJwdVpUtNip9u.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2CeYnsEH2TnR9RPJwdVpUtNip9u.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/42"},{"id":"1329299","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":43,"title":{"value":"Episodio 43","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"クシナダのワープや十字レーザーに苦戦する龍馬とアリス。葵が気づいた\"ある法則\"をきっかけに反撃を開始するも、クシナダがプラズマを発して——!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-10-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eKyAE3phcm5zxLoEVOkKs4TqAiP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eKyAE3phcm5zxLoEVOkKs4TqAiP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/43"},{"id":"1329300","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":44,"title":{"value":"Episodio 44","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"クシナダを打ち破り志乃を取り戻したが、激戦による爪痕は深く、モンスターとの闘いは現実世界に大きな影響を与え始めていた。 これからの闘いに不安を覚えるレンたちの元に、春馬から「素粒子研究センターの場所を突き止めた」と連絡が入る——！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-10-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":11,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wYsP7AdSKYYoeEdje4I46vr2j2p.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wYsP7AdSKYYoeEdje4I46vr2j2p.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/44"},{"id":"1329301","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":45,"title":{"value":"Episodio 45","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"素粒子研究センターを破壊し街中に降臨したバベルは、神ノ原の人々を襲いはじめる！ バベルが言い放った「死よりも深い絶望」が意味するものとは……!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-10-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":11,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ssRayZltJZ2m5k8LUVfn22g0Zez.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ssRayZltJZ2m5k8LUVfn22g0Zez.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/45"},{"id":"1329302","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":46,"title":{"value":"Episodio 46","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"春馬の記憶を取り戻すため、バベルへ総攻撃を仕掛けるレンたち。しかし、バベルは龍馬たちの攻撃をものともしない……。 苦境に立たされたレンたちのもとに、\"白衣の天使\"が舞い降りる！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-10-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uYjvdAFBuMKn5jcOWUZiDkKI3mc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uYjvdAFBuMKn5jcOWUZiDkKI3mc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/46"},{"id":"1329303","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":47,"title":{"value":"Episodio 47","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"バベル撃破へ決意を新たにしたレンたちは、ナイチンゲールを筆頭に、卑弥呼やロミオとタッグを組んで攻撃を畳み掛ける！ しかし、”あること”をきっかけに、バベルはオラゴンへの集中砲火をはじめる......！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-11-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g5LB6nlXb6bWbZDddAdDjJUWK21.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g5LB6nlXb6bWbZDddAdDjJUWK21.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/47"},{"id":"1329304","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":48,"title":{"value":"Episodio 48","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"バベルにひとり立ち向かうオラゴンに、放たれた閃光が直撃する......！ 苦しむオラゴンに触れた瞬間、あたりを謎の光が包み込む。光の先には、レンとオラゴンの記憶の底にある、“大切な場所”が広がっていた——。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-11-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iuw10b4eMZSLCuZzrcT0acszPcR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iuw10b4eMZSLCuZzrcT0acszPcR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/48"},{"id":"1329305","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":49,"title":{"value":"Episodio 49","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"突如現れた謎の少年、その正体は「光の闘神 カルマ」だった！ これまで倒してきた闘神たちに次々と姿を変えるカルマ。その攻撃に翻弄されながらも、ある作戦で打ち破ろうとするレンたちだが…!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-11-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":11,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jYb0iskyLQ2jY3z6HwWokIi8lhH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jYb0iskyLQ2jY3z6HwWokIi8lhH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/49"},{"id":"1329306","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":50,"title":{"value":"Episodio 50","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"カルマを攻撃するたびに弱体化し、身動きが取れなくなる\"因果の法則\"に翻弄されるレンたち。明はあることに気づき神威で攻撃するが、カルマの凶刃に倒れてしまう。 攻撃の術を失う明だが、玄馬より託されたスマホを使い、突破口を切り開く——！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-11-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":12,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qMHoR2I4eT69LzAQItxT1lotfxA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qMHoR2I4eT69LzAQItxT1lotfxA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/50"},{"id":"1329307","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":51,"title":{"value":"Episodio 51","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"葵、皆実、明の記憶が全て奪われ、絶望の淵に立たされるレン。 その時、スマホから\"聞き馴染みのある声\"が鳴り響く！レンはスマホを手に取り、最後の力を振り絞ってカルマとの最終決戦に挑む――!!","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-12-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":12,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kaQZxc6hK7Rz5C5kmFqJAQMcQew.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kaQZxc6hK7Rz5C5kmFqJAQMcQew.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/69084/season/1/episode/51"},{"id":"2344896","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":52,"title":{"value":"Episodio 52","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"闘神を倒し平穏な日常